              "_type": "block",
              "style": "normal",
              "markDefs": [],
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "c2l4-022s1",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Basic ₹1,00,000 a month, HRA ₹50,000, special allowance ₹50,000, gross ₹2,00,000. She rents a 3BHK in Whitefield for ₹45,000 a month. Section 80C: ₹1,50,000; Section 80D: ₹25,000.",
