            {
              "_key": "c2l4-025",
              "_type": "block",
              "style": "normal",
              "markDefs": [],
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "c2l4-025s1",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "A ₹4,20,000 exemption saving ₹1,31,040 sounds decisive. Yet the new regime is still ₹60,060 cheaper for Ritu. The new regime's lower rates on income up to ₹24 lakh are worth more than her HRA plus her 80C and 80D claims. She would need significantly more deductions, such as home loan interest, for the old regime to win.",
                  "marks": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
